[00:12.10]God has commanded us this day;
[00:15.60]He has given us a charge to obey.
[00:22.92]At all times, be ready to impart
[00:27.34]The reason for the hope within your heart.
[00:33.57](Chorus)
[00:33.72]So preach the word
[00:35.85]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[00:39.82]Preach the word,
[00:42.08]For we know the end is near.
[00:45.62]Preach the word,
[00:47.48]Help the meek to understand.
[00:51.42]Preach the word
[00:53.56]Throughout the land!
[01:06.40]Seasons of trouble we will face;
[01:11.94]Opposition may bring shame and disgrace.
[01:17.84]Though preaching may out of season seem,
[01:22.80]Our trust is in our God, who is supreme.
[01:28.51](Chorus)
[01:28.66]So preach the word
[01:30.90]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[01:34.88]Preach the word,
[01:36.60]For we know the end is near.
[01:40.59]Preach the word,
[01:42.32]Help the meek to understand.
[01:46.32]Preach the word
[01:48.52]Throughout the land!
[02:01.64]Seasons of favor we will see,
[02:05.62]And the need for us to teach, there will be.
[02:12.80]The way to salvation we proclaim
[02:18.52]And help to sanctify Jehovah’s name.
[02:23.45](Chorus)
[02:23.60]So preach the word
[02:25.38]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[02:29.66]Preach the word,
[02:31.84]For we know the end is near.
[02:35.56]Preach the word,
[02:37.72]Help the meek to understand.
[02:41.30]Preach the word
[02:43.27]Throughout the land!
